OL,3,GNEWSAPublic confidence 'damaged' by
OL,4,Aon-the-run killer case, says Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic confidence in the justice system
OL,7,Fhas been "damaged" by the circumstances
OL,8,Fsurrounding the temporary release from
OL,9,Fprison of convicted murderer Gary
OL,10,FAnderson, Justice Minister Naomi Long
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FAnderson, who is one of two brothers
OL,14,Fjailed for life in 2023 for the 2018
OL,15,Fmurder of Karol Kelly in Londonderry,
OL,16,Fremains at large a week after he
OL,17,Fabsconded while attending his father's
OL,18,Ffuneral in Londonderry last Monday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
