OL,3,GNEWSAPublic confidence 'damaged' by
OL,4,Aon-the-run killer case, says Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong, who is to meet the murder
OL,7,Fvictim's family, is ordering an
OL,8,Findependent review into the
OL,9,Fcircumstances surrounding Anderson's
OL,10,Frelease from Maghaberry Prison.
OL,12,FThat happened after a court overturned
OL,13,Fa decision by the prison service to
OL,14,Frefuse him permission to attend the
OL,15,Ffuneral.
